\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The ROC curve for our disruption classifier. The integral (AUC) of the ROC characterizes a classifier's performance, with a score of 1 indicating 100\% true positives and 0\% false negatives. Our model has an AUC of 0.9902, close to the hypothetical maximum. }}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
